China Why children’s solid wood furniture use pine wood?
It’s easy to use pine. I’ll do a little expansion on how to choose pine.
Without scar means that the diameter of the tree is big, branches are less, such products mainly are the radiative pine of New Zealand and the Korean pine of Finland, this also is the best quality in pine, the price is the most expensive two kinds, the selective material standard that explains the manufacturer is high. At the same time, the oil of pine will be enriched in the scar, the more pine scar, generally speaking, the greater the taste.
The New Zealand pine is very light in color, and the Finnish pine, although classified as red pine, is actually a very clean light color, quite different from the cloudy yellow of the other more oily pine. Pine of this kind of light color, general taste is smaller, material material is relatively more delicate.
