As we said, This dog leash stands out for its great security and resistance. The finishes are premium, chrome-plated, and ensure that your dog won't break them easily.
This model is a good training leash for your dog. It is made of nylon and has a lot of options for you to choose the one that best suits you and your dogFor example, the length of the strap, which can range from 3 to 30 meters (many comments say, by the way, that it is better to take a rather short strap because if it is not, it gets stuck and is more difficult to handle).
