Dogs are animals that I have always liked a lot. I have been fortunate to live with several throughout my life, and always, on all occasions, the experience has been unforgettable.
I always grew up surrounded by pets like Siamese cats and especially dogs, of different races and sizes. They are the best company that can exist!
I am a great lover of dogs and have been rescuing and taking care of them since I was wearing diapers. I really like the races, but I cannot resist the look and the gestures of the mestizos, with whom I share my day to day.
