WHY SHOULD I CHOOSE A TANK TOP MADE OF SYNTHETIC FABRIC FOR RUNNING?
Do not wear cotton tank tops because, rather than transferring moisture outwards and drying quickly, cotton absorbs body moisture and rapidly cools down the skin. Choose the right tank top for extra comfort during your workout, regardless of the duration.
This tank top is designed to stay dry while you're running. The fabric used absorbs and wicks away perspiration while you exercise, keeping you drier.
Warm, light and comfortable, it's the perfect fleece for your child to take everywhere. Produced from recycled bottles, it is fully in line with our eco-design strategy
The fleece component is designed to trap air in the space formed by its texture; this air acts as a natural insulator, keeping the body warm.It is the brushing of the knit fabric that traps the air. Reduced environmental impact
We developed a fleece knit made of recycled polyester. It comes from recycled industrial scraps and plastic bottles (recycled polyester from 65% bottles and 35% recycled threads).
We conduct numerous laboratory tests to validate the highest standards in terms of durability: a test of resistance to abrasion and friction to ensure that the fleece does not pill, a colour fastness test to check the behaviour and resistance of the colours and an ageing test to check that repeated washing does not alter the properties of the fabric, its behaviour, its thickness or its appearance.
