Breathability Mesh merino wool insert under the arms and on the back.
WHAT ARE OUR COMMITMENTS IN FAVOUR OF ANIMAL WELFARE?
Use of a BETA-SPUN yarn structure in which the polyamide threads coat the Merino wool fibres and protect them from rubbing and cuts without affecting their technical properties.
After any physical effort that involves a lot of perspiration, wool helps to preserve the body temperature while synthetic fabrics cause the temperature to drop faster. The unpleasant cooling or "freezing effect" is therefore reduced by merino wool.
We recommend that you machine wash your Merino wool T-shirt at 30° on a normal cycle, preferably with liquid detergent. Dry flat.
