The KALENJI 900 earphones are worthy of all your favourite tracks, with a miniature version of "bass-reflex" technology, often used in lounge speakers: a tube at the rear of the earphone creates a vent towards the outside. This system provides balanced sound by accentuating the bass which often takes second place in this type of earphone.
