The 500 Ergo Boxing Glove is suited to regular boxing, both for sparring and punching bag training. So to adapt to your workouts, we designed a glove with dual-density foam: the inner layer provides optimal comfort with a very soft density, and the outer, denser layer ensures hand protection for both sparring and punching bag training.
The first thing that we wanted was a glove that ensured greater support, comfort, and cushioning. The next step was a 3-person design team, anatomic studies with the SportsLab, numerous prototypes, a good relationship with our supplier, and use tests with a dozen high-level boxers.
