WHY WEAR FITNESS SHOES?
Our research and development lab has demonstrated specific ways that the foot moves in different sports: a straight stride when running, versus rotations during fitness activities. Wearing the right kind of shoes for your sports activity protects your feet and boosts your performance!
All of our fitness shoes have a 4mm drop. The feeling you get with this 4 mm drop is closer to that of your natural foot position (barefoot = no drop).
Studies have shown that we need 1.7 times more flexion and extension for fitness activities than for running. The ankle's movement also varies depending on the kind of fitness or running you do.
Why is it important?
The 500 men's cardio fitness shoes guarantee multidirectional flexibility as you move while also providing very good support and quality cushioning.
